&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify; mso-pagination: widow-orphan lines-together; page-break-after: avoid; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes;"&gt;&lt;font style="mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Calibri',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin; color: black;"&gt;&amp;#160; &amp;#160; &amp;#160; &amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: 'Calibri',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; color: black;"&gt;During the six months ended June&amp;#160;30, 2026, OGE Energy issued 168,659&amp;#160;shares of new common stock pursuant to OGE Energy's Stock Incentive Plan to satisfy payouts of earned performance units and restricted stock unit grants to OG&amp;amp;E&amp;#8217;s employees.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify; text-indent: .25in; mso-pagination: widow-orphan lines-together; page-break-after: avoid; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes;"&gt;&lt;font style="mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Calibri',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin; color: black;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: 'Calibri',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; color: black;"&gt;During the six months ended June&amp;#160;30, 2026, OGE Energy granted 220,459 performance units (based on total shareholder return over a three-year period) and 129,233 restricted stock units (primarily with a three-year cliff vesting period) to OG&amp;amp;E&amp;#8217;s employees at $56.63 and $46.45 fair value per share, respectively.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify; text-indent: .25in; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes;"&gt;&lt;strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;"&gt;&lt;font style="mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Calibri',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin; color: black;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;font style="mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Calibri',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin; color: black;"&gt;Statement of Cash Flows&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes;"&gt;&lt;font style="mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Calibri',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin; color: black;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;"&gt;&lt;font style="mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Calibri',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin; color: black;"&gt;Supplemental Cash Flow Information&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: 'Calibri',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Calibri',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin; color: black;"&gt;The following table discloses information about investing and financing activities that affected recognized assets and liabilities, but which did not result in cash receipts or payments. Also disclosed in the table is cash paid for interest, net of interest capitalized, and cash paid for income taxes, net of income tax refunds. &lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table class="MsoNormalTable" style="width: 102.5%; background: white; mso-background-themecolor: background1; border-collapse: collapse; mso-yfti-tbllook: 1184; mso-padding-alt: 2.0pt 1.0pt 0in 1.0pt;" border="0" width="102%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0"&gt;

&lt;tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes; page-break-inside: avoid; height: 15.0pt; mso-height-rule: exactly;"&gt;
&lt;td style="width: 79.66%; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .25pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding: 0in 1.0pt 0in 1.0pt; height: 15.0pt; mso-height-rule: exactly;" valign="bottom" width="79%"&gt;
